# Review date: 2026-11-30
CVE-2026-8376

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# CVE-2026-15534 — Superlinear cache overflow (CVSS 7.5)
# Status: PENDING MITIGATION — waiver ini BARU SAH setelah mitigasi
# berikut diimplementasikan dan di-retest (lihat plan §2.3.1):
#   [ ] limit upload <= 10 MB di FastAPI (reject sebelum baca body)
#   [ ] timeout request <= 30 s di uvicorn
#   [ ] retest payload besar -> harus 413, service tetap healthy
# Bukti crash: upload ~286 MB -> HTTP 000 + SIGTERM PID 1 + restart container.
# Review date: 2026-09-15 (paling telat; jangan diperpanjang tanpa fix)
CVE-2026-15534
